<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten meal flat-down, feed unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten meal flat-down, feed unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten meal values were steady to lower and feed values were unchanged Tuesday. Some dealers said a rally in CBOT corn spurred interest in purchases for August and September delivery.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today	 Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq     -    unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   78.00     78.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  345.00    350.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   70.00     70.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
